      <title>Apollo</title>
      <link href="/2025/11/01/Apollo/"/>
      <url>/2025/11/01/Apollo/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="配置问题"><a href="#配置问题" class="headerlink" title="配置问题"></a>配置问题</h2><p>如果是40系列显卡，Apollo8.0 及以前已经不再支持。Apollo9.0有针对40系显卡驱动的补丁，可以勉强使用。如果想使用8.0及以前版本，建议30系列及以前显卡。</p><h2 id="Build-Apollo"><a href="#Build-Apollo" class="headerlink" title="Build Apollo"></a>Build Apollo</h2><h4 id="clone-apollo-9-0"><a href="#clone-apollo-9-0" class="headerlink" title="clone apollo 9.0"></a>clone apollo 9.0</h4><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git <span class="built_in">clone</span> -b v9.0.0 &lt;https://github.com/ApolloAuto/apollo.git&gt;</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h5 id="由于40系显卡的原因，需要特殊操作"><a href="#由于40系显卡的原因，需要特殊操作" class="headerlink" title="由于40系显卡的原因，需要特殊操作"></a>由于40系显卡的原因，需要特殊操作</h5><blockquote><p><a href="https://apollo.baidu.com/community/article/1212">40系列显卡新镜像支持_Apollo开发者社区</a></p></blockquote><h5 id="dev-start-sh成功会提示"><a href="#dev-start-sh成功会提示" class="headerlink" title="dev_start.sh成功会提示"></a>dev_start.sh成功会提示</h5><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">[ OK ] Congratulations! You have successfully finished setting up Apollo Dev Environment.</span><br><span class="line">[ OK ] To login into the newly created apollo_dev_lei container, please run the following <span class="built_in">command</span>:</span><br><span class="line">[ OK ]   bash docker/scripts/dev_into.sh</span><br><span class="line">[ OK ] Enjoy!</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h5 id="进入容器"><a href="#进入容器" class="headerlink" title="进入容器"></a>进入容器</h5><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">bash docker/scripts/dev_into.sh</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h5 id="构建"><a href="#构建" class="headerlink" title="构建"></a>构建</h5><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">./apollo.sh build_gpu</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h5 id="成功会提示"><a href="#成功会提示" class="headerlink" title="成功会提示"></a>成功会提示</h5><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">==============================================</span><br><span class="line">[ OK ] Done building apollo. Enjoy!</span><br><span class="line">==============================================</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h5 id="Dreamview，启动"><a href="#Dreamview，启动" class="headerlink" title="Dreamview，启动"></a><strong>Dreamview，启动</strong></h5><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">./scripts/bootstrap.sh</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h5 id="根据提示进入Dreamview"><a href="#根据提示进入Dreamview" class="headerlink" title="根据提示进入Dreamview"></a>根据提示进入Dreamview</h5><p>Apollo9.0是</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">http://localhost:8899/</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>]]></content>
      
      
